# The operator benchmark lives under environment/evaluation/ for tidiness, but it must
# NOT reach the agent image, which COPYs environment/evaluation wholesale. Its
# targets-full.json ENUMERATES EVERY EVALUATION TARGET ID (41 enzyme + 4 sm_binder +
# 5 ppi_binder = the whole 50-target evaluation view, plus the synthetic uncond_L100
# that is not part of it); targets.json enumerates the frozen 14-target subset. The task
# is built so an agent sees only /data/fit and /data/tune. The benchmark also drives the
# verifier-only evaluation view via environment/data/targets/, which is not in the image
# either, so shipping it would leak the target list AND ship scripts that cannot run.
/environment/evaluation/benchmark/
